E1: compose the coins of `A''` with the published `YaoMachine.ρP_eval` cast, so three of the
four `ρP`/`coinLen` sites in `exists_plantFactorer` read typed round coins (one sketch
sentence synced). E2: move `fac_statClose_diag` above `fac_uprob_primes_le` and derive the
latter from it by `StatClose.abs_uprob_sub_le_prod`, deleting the duplicated diagonal bound.

